===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# An [[expert]].
#* {{quote-text|en|year=1880|author=Francis John Bellew|title=Memoirs of a Griffin; Or, A Cadet's First Year in India|page=202
|passage=The colonel now addressed me, {{...}} adding, "I hope we shall send you to your regiment up the country quite a '''proficient''', and calculated to reflect credit on your instructors in the Zubberdust Bullumteers."}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=1924|author=w:Herman Melville|title=w:Billy Budd|location=London|publisher=Constable & Co.|chapter=10|url=http://gutenberg.net.au/ebooks06/0608511h.html
|passage=Why not subpoena as well the clerical '''proficients'''?}}

